menu "Candis expansion example"

    config CANDIS_EXPANSION_DISPLAY
        bool "Show expansion status on AMOLED"
        depends on SPIRAM
        default n
        help
            Requires an externally powered Candis AMOLED. Uses the board's
            LVGL display and leaves the panel power under its existing owner.

    config CANDIS_EXPANSION_SHARED_SW5
        bool "Sample SW5 on the shared BMI270 INT1 line"
        default n
        help
            Enable after checking the rail sequence and verifying that INT1
            is high impedance for the entire input session.

    config CANDIS_EXPANSION_TF_WRITE_TEST
        bool "Verify write and readback on each inserted Dock test card"
        default n
        help
            Use a writable FAT test card. Create one exclusive 4 KiB test
            file, synchronize it, verify it after reopening, and remove it.

    config CANDIS_EXPANSION_DOCK_MODULE_SCAN
        bool "Probe the two expected Dock module EEPROM addresses"
        default n
        help
            Enable with verified modules and compatible expansion I2C
            pull-ups. Report ACK at addresses 0x51 and 0x52 once after
            the Dock descriptor has been validated.

endmenu
